      "message": "Should we check the mapping status in VelloRenderer.cpp as well? There are two mapped buffers that that requires: a small uniform buffer and a mapped storage buffer to write the scene data into (see lines 309 and 315, https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/skia/src/gpu/graphite/compute/VelloRenderer.cpp;l\u003d309?q\u003dVelloRenderer.cpp\u0026ss\u003dchromium%2Fchromium%2Fsrc:third_party%2Fskia%2F).",
      "revId": "b6ef6f62e82c4ca39803a1ff48930bb4e8622c2a",
