      "side": 1,
      "message": "Missing this check on `mapPtr` is the likely source of b/335848866, which started happening after adding the null checks inside the `BufferWriter`s. This was crashing with very small values, which could come from here if the `Buffer` resource and offset were non-null/zero but `map()` failed.  The later `SkTAddOffset` produces a \"non-null\" value that we\u0027d crash on.",
